POST {{host}}/admin/scholarships
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Example Women in STEM Grant",
  "provider": "Example Foundation",
  "amount": "Approx Rs 1,00,000 per year",
  "eligibility": ["Women enrolled in an undergraduate STEM programme"],
  "deadline": "2027-03-31",
  "link": "https://example.com/grant",
  "domain": "science"
}

@scholarshipId = {{adminCreateScholarship.response.body.$.data.scholarship.id}}


### Update a scholarship
PATCH {{host}}/admin/scholarships/{{scholarshipId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "amount": "Approx Rs 1,50,000 per year"
}


### Delete a scholarship — expect 204
DELETE {{host}}/admin/scholarships/{{scholarshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


# --- Chat issues and bots ---

### All chat issues, with user, message and conversation populated
# @name adminIssues
GET {{host}}/admin/chat/issues?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

@issueId = {{adminIssues.response.body.$.data.0.id}}


### Filter by status: open | in_progress | resolved
GET {{host}}/admin/chat/issues?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Filter by type: provider_error | timeout | user_report
GET {{host}}/admin/chat/issues?type=provider_error
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Set an issue in progress with a note
PATCH {{host}}/admin/chat/issues/{{issueId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "adminNote": "Chasing the bot owner."
}


### Resolve it (stamps resolvedBy and resolvedAt)
PATCH {{host}}/admin/chat/issues/{{issueId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "resolved",
  "adminNote": "Bot was restarted."
}


### Retry a failed message: re-calls the provider, replaces the content, resolves the issue.
### Returns 502 RETRY_FAILED if the provider is still down.
POST {{host}}/admin/chat/issues/{{issueId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### All bot configs, each showing source: env | database
GET {{host}}/admin/chat/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Change the medical bot URL and timeout
PATCH {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/medical
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "url": "http://localhost:5000",
  "timeoutMs": 15000,
  "enabled": true
}


### Disable the legal bot (routing then falls back to general)
PATCH {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/legal
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enabled": false
}


### Re-enable it
PATCH {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/legal
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enabled": true
}


### Test ping a bot — sends "ping", returns ok and latencyMs
POST {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/medical/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Test the legal bot
POST {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/legal/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Test the general bot (ok false when LLM_API_KEY is empty)
POST {{host}}/admin/chat/bots/general/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
